# QuickJS is SEEDED by build.sh (copied from a known-good checkout, or cloned
# as a fallback), not authored here -- and it is far larger than the runtime
# itself. Keep the engine source and its objects out of the repo; build.sh
# reproduces both from scratch. main.wasm IS committed: it is the shipped
# artifact a bezel package uses as its entry, same as the Lua runtime's.
vendor/
obj/
